msgid "Type a domain to search what photondns currently has cached. The 15 closest cached records appear as you type (↓/↑ to move, Enter to pick); selecting one runs a full resolve (cache-first) and shows the answers, route, TTL and timing, which routing rule sent it there (suffix / exact match, China list, ad list, ...), which upstream answered, who hosts the domain (DNS provider, nameservers, CDN) and a live speed comparison of every upstream in the group. Answer IPs get a country flag (looked up by your browser at ipwho.is). URLs are reduced to their host name. Pressing Enter without a selection resolves exactly what you typed."
msgstr "输入域名，搜索 photondns 当前缓存的内容。输入时显示最接近的 15 条缓存记录（↓/↑ 移动，回车选择）；选中后执行完整解析（优先缓存），显示应答、路由、TTL 和耗时，以及命中的分流规则（后缀 / 完全匹配、国内列表、广告列表等）、由哪个上游应答、域名托管在哪里（DNS 服务商、权威域名服务器、CDN），并实时对比该分组所有上游的速度。应答 IP 会显示国旗和国家（由你的浏览器向 ipwho.is 查询）。粘贴网址会自动提取主机名。未选中时按回车则解析所输入的内容。"

msgid "Type a domain to search what photondns currently has cached. The 15 closest cached records appear as you type; selecting one runs a full resolve and shows the answers, route, TTL and timing, which routing rule sent it there, which upstream answered, who hosts the domain (DNS provider, nameservers, CDN) and a live speed comparison of every upstream in the group. Answer IPs get a country flag (looked up by your browser at ipwho.is). URLs are reduced to their host name."
msgstr "输入域名，搜索 photondns 当前缓存的内容。输入时显示最接近的 15 条缓存记录；选中后执行完整解析，显示应答、路由、TTL 和耗时，以及命中的分流规则、由哪个上游应答、域名托管在哪里（DNS 服务商、权威域名服务器、CDN），并实时对比该分组所有上游的速度。应答 IP 会显示国旗和国家（由你的浏览器向 ipwho.is 查询）。粘贴网址会自动提取主机名。"

